ZULM HOTA HAI NAYA DEKHO YAHA AYE ABBAS,<br>
 HAI WO ZAINAB KI NIGAHAO MEIN DHUWA AYE ABBAS<br>
<br>
EK LAMHE KI DULHAN BEWA BANI HAI BAN MEIN,<br>
 GHAM SIWA HOTA HAI HO AAP KAHA AYE ABBAS<br>
<br>
LAILA PHIR CHAND SE CHEHRE KO KAHA PAYEGI,<br>
 YAAD AATI HAI MUJHE USS KI AZAAN AYE ABBAS<br>
<br>
YAAD TADPATI HAI HAR PAL JAWAN AKBAR KI MUJHE,<br>
 DIL KI DHADKAN MEIN HAI WO DARD PINHAA AYE ABBAS<br>
<br>
PAANI KE BADLE MILA TEER-E-SITAM ASGHAR KO,<br>
 PHIR NA KHOLEGA KOI APNI ZUBAAN AYE ABBAS<br>
<br>
PHOOL SE GAAL TAMACHHOY SE HUE HAI NEELE,<br>
 HAR SITAM PAR HAIN SAKINA KI FUGA AYE ABBAS<br>
<br>
KHAT JO SUGRA KA MILA AAINE SHAHADAT SHEH KO, <br>
YAADE SUGRA MEIN THE BUS AANSOO RAWAAN AYE ABBAS<br>
<br>
AAP KE BAAD SITAM ASHQHIYA WO DHATE HAIN,<br>
 AAJ MEHSHAR SE BHI BADHKAR HAIN SAMAA AYE ABBAS<br>
 <br>
LAB KO JUMBISH THI SHAHE WALA KO BHAI KE LIYE,<br>
 YAAD KARTE THE SHAHE KOUN-O-MAKAAN AYE ABBAS<br>
<br>
WAADA EK MAA NE KIYA THA JO KABHI TIIFHLI MAIN, <br>
AAYI ZEHRA KI SADA AAGAYI MAA AYE ABBAS<br>
<br>
SHUMR AB PYAASE GALE PAR HAI CHALATA KHANJAR,<br>
 CHHODKAR BHAI KO HOO AAP KAHA AYE ABBAS<br>
<br>
HAYE WO SHAM-E-GHAREEBA WO QAYAMAT KI GHADI,<br>
 JALTE KHAIMOU SE WO UTHTA THA DHUWAA AYE ABBAS<br>
<br>
YEHI KOOFA HAI JO THA SHAAN-E-ARAB HYDER KA,<br>
 NANGE SAR BIBIYAN AAYI HAIN YAHA AYE ABBAS<br>
<br>
HAYE BIMAAR RAHE TAUQ-O-SALASIL KA AASIR,<br>
 DARD-E-DIL BANGAYE ZAKHMOU KE BAYYAN AYE ABBAS<br>
<br>
SHAAM KE DAAL KE MAJLIS KI BINA ZAINAB NE,<br>
 SAATH MEIN LAYI WATAN HAQ KE NISHA AYE ABBAS<br>
<br>
MUMTAYEE HOKE WAHANHONGEY MERE BHAI WAHAN,<br>
 TANHA SUGRA HAI MADINE YAHAN AYE ABBAS<br>
<br>
ZIKRE ZAINAB KE SABAB DEEN BACHA HAI IQBAL,<br>
 HAQ O BATIL MEIN KIYA FARQ-E-AYAAN AYE ABBAS..